			"id": "agent-analysis-layout-collection-codegen-and-attribute-modifiers",
			"interpretation": "The componentdetailview layout-collection scope (columnview, flex, grid, list, rowview, stackview, swiperView, tabview, waterflow) implements a uniform per-component pattern: a viewmodel CodeGenerator consumes OriginAttribute[] and emits a complete ArkUI component source snippet; an AttributeMapping entity supplies map data keyed by DEFAULT_KEY for default attribute code; a Descriptor holds typed attribute state; and an @Observed AttributeModifier extends CommonAttributeModifier<Descriptor, Attribute>, overriding applyNormalAttribute to push descriptor getters onto the rendered instance via assignAttribute (e.g. Row/Column alignItems, Stack alignContent). GridCodeGenerator.generate mutates private fields by switching on attribute.name (columnsGap, rowsGap, columnsNum/rowsNum via StringUtil.getTemplateString, operationMode via JSON.parse), then returns a template literal containing the Grid's scroller, gap, template and drag/drop behavior (onItemDragStart/onItemDrop with pixelMapBuilder from grid/component/PixelMapBuilder). Public boundary per component: the exported generator class, descriptor type, and modifier class; cross-boundary relations point to shared ../../../viewmodel/CommonCodeGenerator, CommonAttributeModifier, Attribute (OriginAttribute), util/StringUtil, and sibling ../../common/entity/CommonMapData. Observable contract: given the same attribute list, each generator deterministically regenerates component source with defaults replaced by current values; modifiers deterministically map descriptor fields to one or more instance attribute calls. Maintenance must keep generator switch cases, mapping keys, and modifier applyNormalAttribute bindings in lockstep across all nine layout families.",
			"kind": "analysis",
			"limitations": ["CommonAttributeModifier.assignAttribute and CommonCodeGenerator shared implementations are outside the preloaded evidence and their exact dispatch semantics are unverified.","Whether all nine component families instantiate these generators/modifiers identically at runtime (view/page wiring) is not shown by the inspected blobs."],
